Package: com.anlai.omnicar
Name: OmniCar
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Unlock every limit of CarPlay.
 OmniCar takes CarPlay beyond what Apple allows - more freedom, more
 features and everything you need on the road, all in one place.
 .
 Features:
  - CarSplash: play your own startup video on the CarPlay screen every time
    you connect - add clips from Photos or Files, choose the duration, Fill
    or Fit, sound through the car speakers, tap to skip
  - More CarPlay upgrades are on the way
 .
 Every feature has its own switch and settings page under Settings > OmniCar.
 Changes apply the next time CarPlay connects.
 .
 Compatibility: iOS 15 and later, rootless jailbreaks (Dopamine, palera1n).
 Replaces the standalone CarSplash tweak.
Icon: file:///var/jb/Library/PreferenceBundles/OmniCarPrefs.bundle/PackageIcon.png
Maintainer: AnLai <laihoangan123456@gmail.com>
Author: AnLai <laihoangan123456@gmail.com>
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader, firmware (>= 15.0)
Conflicts: carsplash-rootless
Replaces: carsplash-rootless
